 stages · {{tasks}} tasks\",generationProgress:\"{{done}}/{{total}} done\",diffLabel:\"Diff\",diffSummary:\"+{{nodes}} tasks · {{decisions}} node decisions · +{{edges}} edges\",diffEmpty:\"No topology changes\",active:\"active\",idempotency:\"idempotency {{key}}\",generationId:\"generation {{id}}\",parentId:\"parent {{id}}\",verdict:\"verdict {{id}}\",verdictWithOutcome:\"{{outcome}} {{id}}\",continuation:\"continuation {{id}}\",stageRevisionTitle:\"{{revision}} added by a later DAG evolution revision\"}},actions:{menu:\"Actions\",hideGoal:\"Hide goal\",showGoal:\"Show goal\",pause:\"Pause\",discard:\"Discard\",reopen:\"Reopen\",evolution:\"Evolution\",edit:\"Edit\",start:\"Start\",archive:\"Archive\",delete:\"Delete\",archiveTitle:\"Archive this plan and all its tasks (terminal, cannot be undone)\",deleteTitle:\"Delete this plan (unloads its tasks to the Backlog, cannot be undone)\"},lifecycle:{pause:\"Pause\",resume:\"Resume\",start:\"Start\"},meta:{progress:\"Progress\",target:\"Target\",creator:\"Creator\"},rail:{nodesDone:\"nodes done\"},goal:{close:\"Close goal\",title:\"Plan goal\",heading:\"Goal\",empty:\"No goal set.\",showLess:\"Show less\",showMore:\"Show more\"},upNext:{title:\"Up next\",empty:\"No nodes queued.\",more:\"+{{count}} more — view DAG\"},deleteModal:{title:\"Delete this plan?\",body:\"This unloads all this plan's tasks back to the Backlog, permanently deletes the plan's conversation, and deletes the plan. This cannot be undone.\",confirm:\"Delete plan\",pending:\"Deleting…\"},archiveModal:{title:\"Archive this plan?\",body:\"This hides the terminal plan from active views while preserving its done/discarded lifecycle truth and execution history.\",confirm:\"Archive plan\",pending:\"Archiving…\"},discardModal:{title:\"Discard this plan?\",body:\"This permanently abandons the plan and discards its unfinished tasks. Completed tasks and stage history remain immutable.\",confirm:\"Discard plan\",pending:\"Discarding…\"},editModal:{aria:\"Edit plan