tory with <contents>Contents: Read-only</contents> (add <prs>Pull requests: Read</prs> to view PRs). A GitHub App installation token or a read-only deploy key works too. Public repos can leave this blank.\",cancel:\"Cancel\",saving:\"Saving…\",save:\"Save\"}},lj={title:\"Model catalog\",subtitle:\"The org-level, user-managed set of models your agents may run. No built-in entries — you manage them all.\",add:\"+ Add model\",edit:\"Edit\",delete:\"Delete\",cancel:\"Cancel\",save:\"Save\",empty:\"No models yet\",emptyDesc:\"Add a model or import a JSON catalog below.\",addTitle:\"Add model\",editTitle:\"Edit model\",deleteTitle:\"Delete model\",deleteConfirm:'Delete model \"{{name}}\" from the catalog?',col:{modelId:\"Model ID\",displayName:\"Display name\",inputCost:\"Input $/MTok\",outputCost:\"Output $/MTok\",contextWindow:\"Context\",tier:\"Tier\"},import:{button:\"Bulk import (JSON)\",title:\"Bulk import (JSON)\",help:\"Paste a JSON array of entries. Upsert merges by model_id; replace swaps the whole catalog. Any invalid entry (bad schema, duplicate model_id, negative cost) rejects the whole batch.\",upsert:\"Upsert\",replace:\"Replace\",run:\"Import\",close:\"Close\",parseError:\"Invalid JSON: {{detail}}\",notArray:\"Invalid JSON: expected an array of entries.\",failed:\"Import failed — 0 of {{count}} entries applied.\",result:\"Imported {{imported}} entries ({{failed}} failed).\",ok:\"Imported {{count}} entries.\"}},oj={title:\"Secrets\",new:\"New secret\",revoke:\"Revoke\",disclaimer:\"Values are stored encrypted and never displayed after creation. To rotate a secret, revoke and create a new one.\",empty:{title:\"No secrets yet\",body:\"Secrets store API keys + tokens that agents reference at runtime. Values are encrypted at rest and never displayed after creation.\"},column:{name:\"Name\",kind:\"Kind\",state:\"State\",created:\"Created\"},confirm:{title:\"Revoke secret?\",message:'Revoke secret \"{{name}}\"? This cannot be undone.'},modal:{title:\"New secret\"