g to, and the top bar can filter by team.\",col:{identity:\"Identity\",orgRole:\"Org role\",teamRole:\"Team role\",membership:\"Membership\",invite:\"Invite\",teams:\"Teams\",email:\"Email\",created:\"Created\",lastActive:\"Last active\"}},Sj={title:\"Teams\",newTeam:\"New Team\",empty:{title:\"No teams yet\",body:\"Create your first squad — declare the role mix and team-memory (Phase-1 does not mint agents; they are enrolled at runtime).\",action:\"+ New Team\"},col:{team:\"Team\",roles:\"Roles\",members:\"Members\",projects:\"Projects\",status:\"Status\",created:\"Created\"}},wj={roles:{edit:\"Edit roles\",add:\"+ Add role\",addFirst:\"Add first role\",delete:\"Delete\",open:\"Open Team Roles\",title:\"Edit role definitions\",subtitle:\"Add, configure, or remove roles. Roles assigned to members cannot be removed or renamed.\",save:\"Save roles\",saveRuntime:\"Save function config\",previewAccess:\"Preview permission impact\",runtimePanel:\"Function configuration\",accessPanel:\"Permission configuration\",confirmAccessTitle:\"Apply permission changes\",confirmAccessMessage:\"This immediately changes {{roles}} Team Roles and {{members}} members after CAS validation.\",confirmAccessApply:\"Apply now\",invalid:\"Every role needs a unique name.\",saveSuccess:\"Role changes saved.\",listTitle:\"Team Roles\",listHint:\"Select a Team Role to inspect work and access configuration.\",emptyTitle:\"No Team Roles\",emptyBody:\"Add a Team Role before configuring work or access.\",concurrency:\"concurrency {{count}}\",membersCount:\"{{count}} members\",ramRolesCount:\"{{count}} RAM Roles\",deleteSuccess:\"Role {{role}} deleted and members reassigned.\",deleteTitle:\"Delete {{role}} role\",deleteImpact:\"This affects {{members}} members and {{projects}} linked projects.\",deleteProtected:\"This role is protected and cannot be deleted.\",reassignLabel:\"Reassign affected members to\",confirmNameLabel:\"Type {{role}} to confirm\",deleteConfirm:\"Delete role\",deleteLoading:\"Calculating delete impact…\",previewTitle:\"Save preview\",affectedSummary:\"{{roles}} changed roles · {{members}} affected members\",effectiveHint:\"Role config and RAM Role changes take effect immediately for new permission checks; running work keeps any already-snapshotted runtime context until it restarts.\",diffEmpty:\"No role changes.\",noAffectedMembers:\"No currently enrolled members are affected.\"},backToTeams:\"← Teams\",notFound:\"team_not_found\",tabs:{overview:\"Overview\",roles:\"Roles\",members:\"Members\",projects:\"Linked projects\",memory:\"Team Memory\",settings:\"Settings\"},membersRoles:\"{{members}} members · {{roles}} roles\",projectsCount:\"{{count}} projects\",createdAt:\"created {{date}}\",memoryHeading:\"⌗ team-memory\",overview:{roleMix:\"Role definitions\",roleMixHint:\"runtime defaults\",roleSpec:\"{{cli}} · {{model}} · max {{conc}} tasks / agent\",ramUsedBy:\"Used by {{count}} members\",noRamRoles:\"No RAM role mapped\",summary:\"Team overview\",summaryHint:\"structure + team-memory\",enrolledMembers:\"Enrolled members\",declaredRoles:\"Declared roles\",linkedProjects:\"Linked projects\",teamMemory:\"team-memory\",memoryEntries:\"{{count}} entries\",runningTasks:\"Running tasks\",blockedTasks:\"Blocked tasks\",healthNote:\"Running / blocked tasks and member presence are live runtime telemetry; Phase-1 has not wired the facade aggregate yet — real values land once it is connected (showing — for now).\"},members:{title:\"Members\",addMember:\"+ Add member\",exclusivityNote:\"<b>Exclusivity rule:</b> an agent belongs to exactly one team at a time (adding one already elsewhere → a second migration confirm); a human may join many teams.\",emptyTitle:\"No members yet\",emptyBody:\"Click + Add member to enroll an agent / human into a declared role.\",colMember:\"Member\",colKind:\"Type\",colDeclaredRole:\"Declared role\",colCliModel:\"CLI / Model\",colCapabilities:\"Capabilities\",colConcurrency:\"Concurrency\",colPermissionSource:\"Permission sou