on\",forceDeleteConfirmMessage:\"Force-delete organization {{name}}? This removes it from the organization switcher and disables its joined members. This cannot be undone from the UI.\",forceDeleteConfirmLabel:\"Force Delete\"},modal:{title:\"Organization Settings\",close:\"Close\",loading:\"Loading…\",notFound:\"Organization not found.\",nameLabel:\"Name\",slugLabel:\"Slug (changing this changes the URL)\",descriptionLabel:\"Description\",saving:\"Saving…\",save:\"Save\",dangerZone:\"Danger Zone\",deleteOrganization:\"Delete Organization\",deleteConfirmPrefix:\"Delete \",deleteConfirmSuffix:\"? This cannot be undone, and you must be an owner.\",cancel:\"Cancel\",deleting:\"Deleting…\",confirmDelete:\"Confirm delete\",updateSuccess:\"Organization info updated\",updateError:\"Update failed\",deleteError:\"Delete failed, please try again\",nameRequired:\"Please enter an organization name\",slugTooShort:\"Slug must be at least 3 characters\",slugTooLong:\"Slug must be at most 40 characters\",slugInvalidChars:\"Slug may only contain [a-z0-9-]\",slugHyphenEdge:\"Slug cannot start or end with a hyphen\"}},rj={title:\"Repositories\",subtitle:\"Workspace-level code repos. Projects reference them; credentials are configured here only.\",addRepo:\"+ Add repo\",empty:{title:\"No repositories yet\",body:\"Add a workspace repository so projects can reference it. Click + Add repo to create one.\"},delete:{title:\"Delete repository?\",message:'Delete \"{{label}}\"? This will permanently remove its stored credential. This cannot be undone.',messageRefs_one:'Delete \"{{label}}\"? This will drop its reference from {{count}} project and permanently remove its stored credential. This cannot be undone.',messageRefs_other:'Delete \"{{label}}\"? This will drop its reference from {{count}} projects and permanently remove its stored credential. This cannot be undone.',confirm:\"Delete\"},card:{usedBy_one:\"used by {{count}} project\",usedBy_other:\"used by {{count}} projects\",viewRemote:\"