es take effect immediately for new permission checks; running work keeps any already-snapshotted runtime context until it restarts.\",diffEmpty:\"No role changes.\",noAffectedMembers:\"No currently enrolled members are affected.\"},backToTeams:\"← Teams\",notFound:\"team_not_found\",tabs:{overview:\"Overview\",roles:\"Roles\",members:\"Members\",projects:\"Linked projects\",memory:\"Team Memory\",settings:\"Settings\"},membersRoles:\"{{members}} members · {{roles}} roles\",projectsCount:\"{{count}} projects\",createdAt:\"created {{date}}\",memoryHeading:\"⌗ team-memory\",overview:{roleMix:\"Role definitions\",roleMixHint:\"runtime defaults\",roleSpec:\"{{cli}} · {{model}} · max {{conc}} tasks / agent\",ramUsedBy:\"Used by {{count}} members\",noRamRoles:\"No RAM role mapped\",summary:\"Team overview\",summaryHint:\"structure + team-memory\",enrolledMembers:\"Enrolled members\",declaredRoles:\"Declared roles\",linkedProjects:\"Linked projects\",teamMemory:\"team-memory\",memoryEntries:\"{{count}} entries\",runningTasks:\"Running tasks\",blockedTasks:\"Blocked tasks\",healthNote:\"Running / blocked tasks and member presence are live runtime telemetry; Phase-1 has not wired the facade aggregate yet — real values land once it is connected (showing — for now).\"},members:{title:\"Members\",addMember:\"+ Add member\",exclusivityNote:\"<b>Exclusivity rule:</b> an agent belongs to exactly one team at a time (adding one already elsewhere → a second migration confirm); a human may join many teams.\",emptyTitle:\"No members yet\",emptyBody:\"Click + Add member to enroll an agent / human into a declared role.\",colMember:\"Member\",colKind:\"Type\",colDeclaredRole:\"Declared role\",colCliModel:\"CLI / Model\",colCapabilities:\"Capabilities\",colConcurrency:\"Concurrency\",colPermissionSource:\"Permission source / Scope\",sourceTeamRole:\"team_member → Team Role\",scopeTeam:\"scope team:{{teamId}}\",configureAccess:\"Configure permissions\",exclusiveTag:\"exclusive\",remove:\"Rem